# Avocado TUI

Terminal-native Python scratchpad: edit a `.py` file on the left and see per-line results on the right.

## Install (dev)

```bash
python -m pip install -e .
```

## Run

```bash
avocado path/to/file.py
```

## Keys

- Ctrl+S: save
- Ctrl+O: open
- Ctrl+Q: quit

